[SIZE="4"][B]Install instructions:[/B][/SIZE]
[LIST=1]
[*]Make a full nandroid backup from recovery.
[*]Wipe data / factory reset (required when coming from CM7 or stock).
[*]Wipe cache and dalvik cache.
[*]Flash the ROM zip from recovery.
[*]Reboot with the USB cable disconnected (see known issues). The first boot takes about a minute.
[/LIST]

[B]Update from a previous CM9 build:[/B]
[LIST=1]
[*]Wipe cache and dalvik cache.
[*]Flash the new build.
[*]Reboot.
[/LIST]

